## Intel oneAPI Compiler Runtime

If planning to install the Intel® oneAPI compiler runtime (see [Optional
Development Tool Builds](#optional-development-tool-builds)), register the
following additional path (`/opt/intel`) to share with computes:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_if_set enable_intel_packages -->
```bash
# (Optional) Setup NFS mount for /opt/intel if planning to install oneAPI packages
mkdir -v /opt/intel
echo "/opt/intel *(ro,no_subtree_check,fsid=12)" >> /etc/exports
{{ compute_echo("${sms_ip}:/opt/intel /opt/intel nfs nfsvers=4,nodev 0 0", "/etc/fstab" ) }}
```
<!-- ohpc_fi -->
<!-- ohpc_end -->
